<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero-card">
    <view class="eyebrow">首次使用</view>
    <view class="hero-title">绑定我的学员身份</view>
    <view class="hero-copy">输入正式入塾时登记的姓名和手机号。系统只会显示最小脱敏信息，不会公开查询其他学员。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-card">
    <view class="field-row">
      <view class="field-label">姓名</view>
      <input class="field-input" placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder" data-field="name" value="{{name}}" bindinput="handleInput" placeholder="请输入正式姓名" />
    </view>
    <view class="field-row">
      <view class="field-label">手机号</view>
      <input class="field-input" placeholder-class="field-input-placeholder" type="number" maxlength="11" data-field="phone" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="handleInput" placeholder="请输入登记手机号" />
    </view>
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="bindIdentity">微信登录并确认绑定</button>
  </view>
  <view class="privacy-copy">绑定成功后，微信身份只作为登录凭证；平台学习记录始终归属于正式学员 member_id。</view>
</view>
